{"ready":true,"data":{"id":"michael-mando","name":"Michael Mando","birthDate":"1981-07-13","birthPlace":"Québec City, Québec, Canada","bio":"Michael Mando (born July 13, 1981) is a Canadian actor. He played Nacho Varga on the AMC series Better Call Saul (2015–2022), Vaas Montenegro in the video game franchise Far Cry (2012, 2021), Vic Schmidt in the sci-fi series Orphan Black (2013–2014), and Mac Gargan/Scorpion in the Marvel Cinematic Universe films Spider-Man: Homecoming (2017) and Spider-Man: Brand New Day (2026). He is a two-time Canadian Screen Award and Screen Actors Guild Award nominee.\n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Michael Mando, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia.","source":"TMDB","fetchedAt":"2026-11-19T17:43:55+00:00","tmdbId":829372,"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/829372","credits":[{"id":"spider-home","title":"Spider-Man: Homecoming","character":"Mac Gargan","characterFa":"مک گارگان"},{"id":"spider-brand","title":"Spider-Man: Brand New Day","character":"Mac Gargan / Scorpion","characterFa":"مک گارگان / عقرب"}],"photo":"./public-data/images/people/michael-mando.webp","filmography":[{"name":"Spider-Man: Brand New Day","year":2026,"character":"Mac Gargan / Scorpion","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/bjiS5ipwxb9JFy3XRRN4OAilSeX.jpg","characterFa":"مک گارگان / عقرب"},{"name":"72 HOURS","year":2026,"character":"Jaze","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/9Bu1PW2R1XayqRqnl0aDOgMcrdS.jpg"},{"name":"Batman: Knightfall Part 1: Knightfall","year":2026,"character":"Bane (voice)","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/360qdtu2hLnqMu8SVHMywn420w1.jpg"},{"name":"Batman: Knightfall Part 2: Knightquest","year":2026,"character":"Bane (voice)","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/9jGwTCEYaOg3xxnKFaL5ukVexLp.jpg"},{"name":"King Ivory","year":2025,"character":"Ramón Garza","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://imag